<table class="about-left-content" style="height: 523px; width: 343px; border-collapse: collapse; float: left;" border="0">
<tbody>
<tr style="height: 17px;">
<td style="width: 316px; height: 72px;"><img style="display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;" src="/mas_studio/storage/image/20180104/5a4d94d9874ee.png" alt="" width="258" height="386" /></td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 18px;">
<td style="width: 316px; height: 18px; background-color: #ffffff; padding-left: 20px; padding-right: 20px;">
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 5pt 0pt; text-indent: 0pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;"><strong style="text-indent: 36pt;"><span class="15" style="font-family: 'Century Gothic'; color: #0c0c0c; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;">Monique S.W.Lee</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 'Century Gothic'; color: #0c0c0c; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;"><br /></span></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 5pt 0pt; text-indent: 0pt;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Century Gothic'; color: #0c0c0c; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;">Design Director</span></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 5pt 0pt; text-indent: 0pt;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Century Gothic'; color: #a4a4a4; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 9pt;">HKIDA</span></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 5pt 0pt; text-indent: 0pt;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Century Gothic'; color: #a4a4a4; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 9pt;">MEMU of Tech Sydney</span></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 5pt 0pt; text-indent: 0pt;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Century Gothic'; color: #a4a4a4; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 9pt;">BAappSc (Arch) CurtinU of Tech</span></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 5pt 0pt; text-indent: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<div class="about-right-content">
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: 24.0000pt;"><span style="mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 'Century Gothic'; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">Monique is ardent towards her design career and had worked in various architectural and interior design companies for over 10 years before she founded her own company in 2009. &nbsp;She acquired extensive experience working through commercial and residential projects, show units for large-scale residential project in Hong Kong, Macau and Mainland China.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: 24.0000pt;"><span style="mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 'Century Gothic'; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">Her designs are known to integrate architecture, art and interior design to carry high aesthetic and functional value. &nbsp;Putting customers&rsquo; concerns on top priority, she is highly regarded by customers for offering professional advice to fulfill personal or commercial expectations.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: 24.0000pt;"><span style="mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 'Century Gothic'; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Century Gothic'; font-size: 12pt;">Our Beliefs:</span></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: 24.0000pt;"><span style="mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 'Century Gothic'; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">MaS Studio Ltd. offers interior designs and construction services. MaS team members value the same vision to offer quality services and fulfil our social obligation to protect the environment. All these guide us to select and use eco-friendly construction and furnishing materials wherever possible.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: 24.0000pt;">&nbsp;</p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 'Century Gothic'; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">Our Services:</span></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: 24.0000pt;"><span style="mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 'Century Gothic'; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">We strive to design and create stylish dwellings for visual and physical comfort. Enhancing overall well-being and building a healthy living environment for our customers area our prime concern .For commercial customers, we are further driven to design to stand out their predominant market values advantageous to business growth. </span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: 24.0000pt;"><span style="mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 'Century Gothic'; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Century Gothic'; font-size: 12pt;">Team Members:</span></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: 24.0000pt;"><span style="mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 'Century Gothic'; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">Under a Mentorship scheme, we offer career opportunities to young talented designers to work with experienced designers. A number of projects which integrate avant-garde design concepts and environmental protection were completed under this scheme. They were well-received among our customers and recognized in international design awards.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: 24.0000pt;"><span style="mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 'Century Gothic'; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Century Gothic'; font-size: 12pt;">Company Exposure: </span></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: 24.0000pt;"><span style="mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 'Century Gothic'; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">Hoping to allow everyone access interior design information and acquire simple skills for enriching their living environment easily, we are sharing our experience and information on contemporary trends with the community through various media platforms, naming &lsquo;CAPITAL WEEKLY&rsquo; magazine, &lsquo;Eastweek.com.hk&rsquo; online, TV programs on interior designs and magazine interviews, etc.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: 24.0000pt;"><span style="mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 'Century Gothic'; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Century Gothic'; font-size: 12pt;">International Recognition:</span></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: 24.0000pt;"><span style="mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 'Century Gothic'; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">In recent years, MaS has actively participated in various design awards naming &lsquo;Successful Design Awards&rsquo; and &lsquo;International Architectural Decoration and Design Art Fair&rsquo; in China, "Capital Magazine" and "Capital Week" design competitions in Hong Kong.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: 24.0000pt;"><span style="mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 'Century Gothic'; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">And our design entries for the "A' Design Awards" in Italy and "German Design Award" in Germany were awarded Silver and Winner prizes respectively.</span></p>
</div>
